{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》參賽者俞可程因捲入假單身風波，其香港版約會戲份遭製作組全數刪走。近日網上平 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》參賽者俞可程因捲入假單身風波，其香港版約會戲份遭製作組全數刪走。近日網上平台意外流出她與Zico在主題樂園約會未刪剪足本片段，瞬間引爆中港兩地粉絲熱烈討論。盤點內地版約會片段的「3大場面」，還原這段充滿話題性、令網民睇到火滾的完整約會！</p>\n<h2>場面一：俞可程主題樂園狂放電 惹來內地彈幕嘲諷</h2>\n<p>除了纜車談心，片段亦保留了二人在主題樂園戶外漫步的互動場面。畫面中可見Zico相當有風度地為Kanis沿途講解及指引方向，而Kanis亦全程表現雀躍。不過，內地網民似乎早已看穿一切，在Zico興致勃勃地與女方互動時，內地版本的畫面上竟無情地打出「好慘的男人」五隻大字！這句字幕猶如「神預言」般精準總結了Zico在節目中被蒙在鼓裡的命運，引發大批香港網民共鳴，紛紛戥男方感到不值。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541089660741751_14169068106b03cbd17d612.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541089660741751_14169068106b03cbd17d612.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541090342020149_10736006376b03cbd7dabc0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.11.37.png/3098x1620_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541090342020149_10736006376b03cbd7dabc0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541091239655474_4699830016b03cbe0d1f0c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.59.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541091239655474_4699830016b03cbe0d1f0c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795410919124349_18414845016b03cbe80a2c0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.10.22.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795410919124349_18414845016b03cbe80a2c0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541092722361871_4559846366b03cbf032b38.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.37.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541092722361871_4559846366b03cbf032b38.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>仲拖手！（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>場面二：俞可程幕後受訪大談熊貓水母 慘遭瘋狂狙擊</h2>\n<p>除了戶外約會互動，未刪剪版本同時播出俞可程單獨幕後訪問片段。畫面可見她坐在高腳椅上接受訪問，期間手舞足蹈大談樂園內動物，配合畫面上出現「熊貓」、「水母」、「企鵝」等字眼。大批知悉假單身風波真相網民狠批她不停玩頭髮及刻意改變聲線，並紛紛留言直指「好鬼作狀」、「聽返平時啲聲差好遠，呢把聲勁姣」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541093525492403_5216383366b03cbf7af479.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.09.54.png/2652x1754_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541093525492403_5216383366b03cbf7af479.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541094506717080_12687986326b03cc01ad92c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.10.01.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541094506717080_12687986326b03cc01ad92c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541095335652208_4351593926b03cc09e7d2d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.15.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541095335652208_4351593926b03cc09e7d2d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>場面三：癡情Zico將迷你小貓公仔珍藏店舖惹人痛心</h2>\n<p>在流出的內地版片段中，其中一幕最令網民深刻的，是Kanis與Zico在纜車上的獨處時光。兩人在纜車內並肩而坐，女方身穿淺藍色吊帶裙展現招牌甜美笑容，氣氛看似相當融洽。其後，兩人更互送禮物，畫面可見Kanis滿面笑容，而Zico則開心手持一隻由Kanis送贈的迷你小貓公仔。   最令網民感到崩潰的是，有眼利粉絲發現Zico對這份節目中的禮物極為重視，現實中竟將這隻小貓公仔擺放在自己經營的店舖「Iceyaki」內作珍藏展示！<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541096228161115_940301856b03cc12eb251.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.32.png/2544x1564_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541096228161115_940301856b03cc12eb251.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民力撐香港製作組大義滅親刪走虐心畫面</h2>\n<p>這段絕密片段在網上瘋傳後，網民對俞可程造作表現給予一面倒負面評價，並紛紛對男方遭遇感到痛心。大批粉絲留言痛斥「仲要放喺舖頭珍而重之？！好虐心喎！」以及「Zico放喺iceyaki嘅其中一隻貓係kanis送嘅？？？？！！」。不少觀眾看完足本版後，強烈支持電視台製作組神剪輯決策，直指幸好香港版本將這些畫面全數刪走。</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/zico/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Zico</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bf%9e%e5%8f%af%e7%a8%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">俞可程</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548598\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:29.006842+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1460,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:45:01.443175+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:46.918832+00:00","content_hash":"39ebb073929f616a66502139a5ce6cf76b90426514eede2ec014a1d4c2dc0b92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}